  "ency.p2": "You issue federal directives. You cannot type “Croatia becomes loyal.” Four political victories exist; war is defeat.",
  "ency.p3": "Monthly drift shows cause and effect: inflation, trade, IMF, customs, logs, Pakrac, and desk posture (including Justice). Reforms, desks and talks move the same numbers — including election night and Presidency votes.",
