  "ency.desksBody": "Nine desks (JNA, SIV, Presidency, SSUP, SSP, Finance, TO, NBY, Justice). Posture feeds monthly drift, federal control, election night, Presidency votes and endings. Attention is shared with reforms — UI shows desks vs reforms spend.",
  "ency.dialogueBody": "Marković (late), Kadijević (late), Drnovšek (multi-visit until 15 May), Jović, Mesić, Kučan (after SI election), Tuđman (after HDZ). Choices set the same flags as event cards.",
